        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0027">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a separator for an electric storage device</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">comprising a microporous membrane comprising a polypropylene resin (A) and a thermoplastic elastomer (B), wherein the microporous membrane has the following regions:</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0028">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">MFR</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">Melt Flow Rate</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0032">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a separator for an electric storage device</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">comprising a microporous membrane comprising a polypropylene resin (A) and a thermoplastic elastomer (B), wherein the microporous membrane has the following regions:</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0033">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a Melt Flow Rate (MFR) of the polypropylene resin (A)</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is 1.0 g/10 minutes or less.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0037">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a separator for an electric storage device</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">comprising a microporous membrane comprising a polypropylene resin (A) and a thermoplastic elastomer (B), wherein the microporous membrane has the following regions:</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0038">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">thermoplastic elastomer (B)</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">forms a region in which a ratio (MD/TD) of a length in the MD to a length in a Transverse Direction (TD) is 1.5 or more.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0042">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">thermoplastic elastomer (B)</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is oriented along the MD of the microporous membrane.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0043">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">thermoplastic elastomer (B)</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is free of propylene.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0045">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">thermoplastic elastomer (B)</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is present in the polymeric matrix, but is not present in the fibrils.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0047">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">thermoplastic elastomer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">in which a hard segment of the thermoplastic elastomer (B) is crystalline, a crystalline melting point peak of the hard segment is 50 to 110° C., or in the case of an amorphous, thermoplastic elastomer in which a hard segment of the thermoplastic elastomer (B) is amorphous, a glass-transition temperature of the hard segment is 30 to 110° C.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0048">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">thermoplastic elastomer (B)</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">a Melt Flow Rate of the thermoplastic elastomer (B) is 2.0 g/10 minutes or more.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0049">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">thermoplastic elastomer (B)</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is ethylene/ ⁇ -olefin copolymer.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0050">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a Melt Flow Rate (MFR) of the microporous membrane</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is 0.1 g/10 minutes or more.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0054">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">separator</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">according to any one of [1] to [16], wherein the separator comprises a microporous multi-layered membrane in which the microporous membrane comprising the polypropylene resin (A) and the thermoplastic elastomer (B) and a microporous membrane comprising a polyethylene as a major component are laminated.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0056">
