        <span itemprop="subject">a needle ( 6 ) having a hemispherical tip with a radius of 0.5 mm</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was prepared, separator ( 1 ) was sandwiched between two plates ( 7 , 7 ) having opening diameters (dia.) of 11 mm, and the needle ( 6 ), separator ( 1 ) and plates ( 7 , 7 ) were set in the positional relationship shown in FIG. 3( a ) .</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0308">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
