        <span itemprop="definition">was set to 260° C., and the molten polymer was cooled by blown air followed by wound into a roll.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0348">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a die temperature</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was set to 260° C., and the molten polymer was cooled by blown air followed by wound into a roll.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0348">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
